## CellProfiler parity - next (planned 2026-10-23, start 2026-10-24)

Where values go: per-object values every object always has → fixed columns in `objects` (like `intensity_mean_gray DOUBLE[]`); values only a measurement step makes → `measurements` (key `<id>/<output>`). Old results `.duckdb` files need not open any more (decided 2026-10-23): change the schema directly, no version or migration.

Order:
- [x] 0. Storage (2026-10-24, remote protocol 29 → 30; numbers in BENCHMARK.md › "Measurement storage and object intensity spread"):
